BT 1 0 0 1 0 97.6 Tm .518986 Tw 9.5 TL /F1 6.9 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (While Phase II established the mathematical and allostatic foundations of Project Ascendant, an honest scientific appraisal recognizes that the deliberative LLM still relies) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.296879 Tw (partially on pre-trained semantic representations. To transition from allostatic prototyping to genuine synthetic intentionality, Phase III charts a four-stage virtual) Tj T* 0 Tw (developmental ontogeny:) Tj  T* 1.0888 Tw (\177 ) Tj /F2 6.9 Tf (Phase III.A \227 Restricted Ontological Pre-Training:) Tj /F1 6.9 Tf ( The agent is initialized with an extremely compact language model \(50M\226100M parameters\) trained strictly on) Tj T* 0 Tw (foundational topological, physical, and homeostatic vocabularies, eliminating ungrounded adult cultural assumptions.) Tj  T* .084029 Tw (\177 ) Tj /F2 6.9 Tf (Phase III.B \227 Progressive Sensorimotor Grounding:) Tj /F1 6.9 Tf ( The neural substrate is updated continuously via dynamic low-rank adapters \(LoRA\) strictly conditioned on verified) Tj T* 0 Tw (autobiographical engrams and empirical physical interactions.) Tj  T* .669218 Tw (\177 ) Tj /F2 6.9 Tf (Phase III.C \227 Social Scaffolding and Cultural Transmission:) Tj /F1 6.9 Tf ( Situated human and peer trainers provide guided ostensive training \(") Tj /F3 6.9 Tf (this berry restores energy) Tj /F1 6.9 Tf (", ") Tj /F3 6.9 Tf (that) Tj T* 0 Tw (predator attacks in shadows) Tj /F1 6.9 Tf ("\), mimicking early childhood language acquisition.) Tj  T* .758488 Tw (\177 ) Tj /F2 6.9 Tf (Phase III.D \227 Representational Autonomy & Idiosyncratic Emergence:) Tj /F1 6.9 Tf ( As generational lineages accumulate cultural heuristics, inter-agent communication evolves) Tj T* 0 Tw (idiosyncratic dialectical representations grounded entirely in their collective historical experience.) Tj T* ET
